Wow, this is quite something. Yesterday, I spoke with the CEO of a mega fleet, who said most of his truckload business was doing well, except for one segment: food and beverage. He called the lack of volume from this segment 'unusual.' I told him we believed GLP-1s were causing a significant slowdown in food and beverage shipments, as we had just completed a market study on GLP-1's impact on freight shipments.

